<attribute name="name" nodeId="98c7a878">Define roles and responsibilities</attribute>
<attribute name="guid" nodeId="f44f8ce9">_Lv6fME2sEeSmOINs1NcrPg</attribute>
<attribute name="presentationName" nodeId="e73f1078">Define roles and responsibilities</attribute>
<attribute name="briefDescription" nodeId="4d742e20"></attribute>
<attribute name="suppressed" nodeId="edb81358">false</attribute>
<attribute name="orderingGuide" nodeId="98b549eb"></attribute>
<attribute name="variabilityType" nodeId="fe630dca">na</attribute>
<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="3e081c2a"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="582e09dd">&lt;p&gt;
    Based on identified resources allocated for the test effort, assign roles and responsibilities within each test level
    defined. Assignment should include owners for work products produced for each test type. Each work product should be
    assigned an owner to&amp;nbsp;indicate&amp;nbsp;responsibility for completing the assigned task. Roles and responsibilities are
    defined to articulate specific stakeholders and resources for assistance, guidance, and decision making when
    needed&amp;nbsp;during the test effort.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
