<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="33f5454f"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="16f4735e">&lt;p&gt;
    Specify start and end dates of each test&amp;nbsp;type for the&amp;nbsp;timely completion of the test effort. Timing of each
    test type should fit well with overall project level timelines.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Additionally, discuss any important milestones that should be monitored throughout the testing
    lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;Milestones are defined and tracked to communicate the project health and status of the test
    effort.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
