<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="4af709d0"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="347c0bc7">Confirm the progress-monitoring metrics, reports, and reporting processes (e.g., metrics, reports and graphs) to be used to
track test progress. Review test metrics and status reporting previously defined during initial stages of the test
effort.&amp;nbsp;Modify test metrics, reporting frequency and other variables as necessary depending on test levels and types
